@startuml
actor Analyst
participant Streamlit
participant Router
participant Research
participant "RAG tool" as RAG
database ChromaDB
participant Reviewer
Analyst -> Streamlit: Submit question
Streamlit -> Router: Invoke graph
alt In scope
  Router -> Research: Invoke research node
  Research -> RAG: Retrieve passages
  RAG -> ChromaDB: Query vector
  ChromaDB --> RAG: Ranked records
  RAG --> Research: Evidence and citations
  Research -> Reviewer: Draft and evidence
  alt Every claim matches
    Reviewer --> Router: Publish cited summary
  else Empty evidence or mismatched claim
    Reviewer --> Router: Withhold draft and give verdict
  end
else Outside scope
  Router -> Router: Set scope reply
end
Router --> Streamlit: Return result
Streamlit --> Analyst: Display result
@enduml
